# Fallback only when a macOS LaunchAgent or Linux user systemd timer is unavailable.
# Replace every placeholder with a verified canonical absolute path or bounded profile ID.
# Cron invokes its command through a shell, so refuse whitespace or shell metacharacters
# in substituted paths. This command itself contains no expansion, redirection, or pipeline.
# BEGIN codex-profile-harness-__PROFILE_ID__
*/15 * * * * __HARNESS_EXECUTABLE__ maintain --profile __PROFILE_ROOT__
# END codex-profile-harness-__PROFILE_ID__
